This licence covers the work of this repository: the episode text, the links
between episodes, the chains, the mechanism definitions, the collector script
and the workflow.

Two things in here are not ours to license, and keep their own terms:

- `data/misalignment-feed.json` carries incident titles and summaries
  reproduced verbatim from the AI Incident Database and the AIAAIC Repository,
  both CC BY-SA, and from the OECD AI Incidents Monitor. That file is not
  MIT — it is redistribution of those records under their own licences, and
  the file names them in its `license` field.
- Episodes quote labs and disclosures in quotation marks. Those sentences
  belong to whoever wrote them; each is attributed on the episode.

Facts are not copyrightable, and an episode written from a source is ours.
Where a source has to be credited, it is credited — reusing this under MIT
does not remove that.
